#. Shown on the Connect screen when the account's data balance has run out: a balance of data, not of money.
msgctxt "insufficient_balance"
msgid "Insufficient balance"
msgstr "Saldo insuficiente"

#. Connection status shown when the network has no data balance left.
msgctxt "insufficient_balance_add_balance_or_plan"
msgid "Insufficient balance — add balance or a plan"
msgstr "Saldo insuficiente — adicione saldo ou um plano"

#. Out-of-balance alert, on the desktop builds whose checkout has to go through the tunnel (Windows, Linux), while the tunnel holds or blocks traffic. Their Disconnect lifts the kill switch too; apple and android say more (insufficient_balance_disconnect_first_kill_switch). Payment cannot reach the store until the user disconnects, and nothing disconnects for them; Disconnect is the button beside this line. Each translation names that button by its own label (the disconnect key).
msgctxt "insufficient_balance_disconnect_first"
msgid "To upgrade, press Disconnect first. Payment can't get through until you do."
msgstr "Para fazer upgrade, escolha primeiro \"Desconectar\". Até lá, o pagamento não será concluído."

#. Out-of-balance alert, on the apple and android builds whose checkout has to go through the tunnel (the macOS direct download, the Android Play flavor), while the tunnel holds traffic. Payment cannot reach the store until the user disconnects, and nothing disconnects for them; Disconnect is the button beside this line. On these apps a kill switch that is on keeps the tunnel up after a Disconnect and still stops the payment, so the line also says to turn it off. Each translation names Disconnect by its own label (the disconnect key) and the kill switch by the label of its setting (the kill_switch key).
msgctxt "insufficient_balance_disconnect_first_kill_switch"
msgid "To upgrade, press Disconnect first, and turn off the kill switch if it's on. Payment can't get through until you do."
msgstr "Para fazer upgrade, escolha primeiro \"Desconectar\" e desative o Kill switch se estiver ativado. Até lá, o pagamento não será concluído."

#. Out-of-balance notice (and the Upgrade screen when a blocked connect opened it), shown when the data is used up and almost nothing is held by open connections, so nothing meaningful will come back on its own. It follows the "Free data refreshes in {time}." line, which says when the free refresh is.
msgctxt "insufficient_balance_exhausted"
msgid "You're out of data until the free refresh or an upgrade."
msgstr "Seus dados acabaram até a renovação grátis ou um upgrade."

#. Alert body shown in the app and in a local notification when the account enters the insufficient balance state. Connect stays requested and the VPN keeps holding traffic (nothing leaves outside the tunnel); the user can upgrade or disconnect.
msgctxt "insufficient_balance_held_notice"
msgid "Your traffic is held in the tunnel until you upgrade or disconnect."
msgstr "Seu tráfego fica retido no túnel até você fazer upgrade ou desconectar."

#. Body of the warning shown when the balance runs out and no session is up; connecting needs more balance or a plan.
msgctxt "insufficient_balance_message"
msgid "Add balance or a plan to keep connecting."
msgstr "Adicione saldo ou um plano para continuar se conectando."

#. Short note shown when the balance comes back (reserved data returned, the free refresh or an upgrade) and the app retries, by itself, the connect that insufficient balance had blocked.
msgctxt "insufficient_balance_reconnecting"
msgid "Data is available again. Reconnecting…"
msgstr "Há dados disponíveis novamente. Reconectando…"

#. Leads the out-of-balance notice (and the Upgrade screen when a blocked connect opened it): when the free daily data is granted again. {time} is the time left until the next 00:00 UTC as a compact duration (e.g. 5h 12m).
msgctxt "insufficient_balance_refreshes_in"
msgid "Free data refreshes in {}."
msgstr "Os dados grátis são renovados em {}."

#. Out-of-balance notice (and the Upgrade screen when a blocked connect opened it), shown when most of what is missing is held by open connections rather than used up. {amount} is the reserved (Pending) data as a size, e.g. 1.4 GB. The unused part is returned as those connections close. Do not add a time promise.
msgctxt "insufficient_balance_reserved"
msgid "{} is reserved for your open connections. What they don't use is returned as they close."
msgstr "{} estão reservados para suas conexões abertas. O que elas não usarem é devolvido à medida que forem fechadas."

#. Out-of-balance notice, while a connect the user asked for is waiting on the balance: the app retries that connect by itself once data is available again (reserved data returned, the free refresh or an upgrade). Shown with a Cancel action when the connect has not started yet.
msgctxt "insufficient_balance_will_reconnect"
msgid "You'll be reconnected when data is available again."
msgstr "Você será reconectado quando houver dados disponíveis novamente."

#. Circle Wallet Transfer Screen
msgctxt "insufficient_funds"
msgid "Insufficient funds"
msgstr "Fundos insuficientes"

#. How to add the quick connect control on iOS (no add-control API).
msgctxt "intro_control_manual_ios"
msgid "Open Control Center, tap +, then Add a Control, and pick URnetwork."
msgstr "Abra a Central de Controle, toque em +, depois em Adicionar um Controle, e escolha URnetwork."

#. How to add the quick connect control on macOS.
msgctxt "intro_control_manual_macos"
msgid "Open Control Center, choose Edit Controls, and add URnetwork."
msgstr "Abra a Central de Controle, escolha Editar Controles e adicione URnetwork."

#. Detail line of the last onboarding page.
msgctxt "intro_quick_connect_details"
msgid "Turn URnetwork on and off from Quick Settings, and keep an eye on it from your home screen."
msgstr "Ative e desative a URnetwork pelas Configurações rápidas e acompanhe tudo pela tela inicial."

#. Detail line of the last onboarding page on iOS/macOS (Control Center instead of Quick Settings).
msgctxt "intro_quick_connect_details_apple"
msgid "Turn URnetwork on and off from Control Center, and keep an eye on it from your Home Screen."
msgstr "Ative e desative a URnetwork pela Central de Controle e acompanhe tudo pela Tela de Início."

#. Title of the last onboarding page: the quick connect tile and the home screen widgets.
msgctxt "intro_quick_connect_title"
msgid "Connect in one tap"
msgstr "Conecte com um toque"

#. Label shown on the last onboarding page once the quick connect tile is in Quick Settings.
msgctxt "intro_quick_tile_added"
msgid "Added to Quick Settings"
msgstr "Adicionado às Configurações rápidas"

#. Manual steps for adding the quick connect tile on Android versions without the system add-tile request (before Android 13).
msgctxt "intro_quick_tile_manual"
msgid "Open Quick Settings, tap the pencil, and drag URnetwork into place."
msgstr "Abra as Configurações rápidas, toque no lápis e arraste a URnetwork para o lugar."

#. Tagline under 'Welcome to URnetwork' on the first onboarding page. Replaces 'URnetwork is the most local and most private network on the planet.'
msgctxt "intro_verifiable_encryption"
msgid "Encryption for everyday use."
msgstr "Criptografia para o dia a dia."

#. Manual steps for adding widgets on launchers without the pin dialog.
msgctxt "intro_widgets_manual"
msgid "Long-press your home screen, choose Widgets, and pick URnetwork."
msgstr "Toque e segure a tela inicial, escolha Widgets e selecione URnetwork."

#. How to add a Home Screen widget on iOS (no pin-widget API).
msgctxt "intro_widgets_manual_ios"
msgid "Long-press the Home Screen, tap +, search URnetwork, and add a widget."
msgstr "Toque e segure a Tela de Início, toque em +, busque URnetwork e adicione um widget."

#. How to add a desktop widget on macOS.
msgctxt "intro_widgets_manual_macos"
msgid "Open the widget gallery from Notification Center, search URnetwork, and drag a widget to the desktop."
msgstr "Abra a galeria de widgets na Central de Notificações, busque URnetwork e arraste um widget para a mesa."

#. Hint under the widget previews on the last onboarding page: tapping a preview asks the launcher to add that widget.
msgctxt "intro_widgets_tap_to_add"
msgid "Tap a widget to add it to your home screen."
msgstr "Toque em um widget para adicioná-lo à tela inicial."

