#. Shown when the post-payment confirmation poll exhausts its budget (2 minutes) without the server confirming the subscription. The payment evidence is real (store or payment sheet reported success), so say that plainly, and head off a second purchase. Android also shows it, without the "Payment received" title, when the 2-minute Solana Pay return-path check ends without the payment landing.
msgctxt "payment_confirmation_delayed"
msgid "Confirmation is taking longer than expected. Your plan will update automatically once it's confirmed — there's no need to buy again."
msgstr "A confirmação está demorando mais que o esperado. Seu plano será atualizado automaticamente assim que for confirmado — não é preciso comprar de novo."

#. Body of the post-purchase overlay while the server has not yet confirmed the subscription. Replaces the optimistic 'You're premium.' claim until currentSubscription actually confirms.
msgctxt "payment_confirmation_processing"
msgid "We're confirming your payment now. Your plan will update automatically — you don't need to do anything."
msgstr "Estamos confirmando seu pagamento agora. Seu plano será atualizado automaticamente — você não precisa fazer nada."

#. Shown in the payment-problem dialog when the Stripe payment sheet reports a failure. The sheet's own error detail is appended by the caller.
msgctxt "payment_not_completed"
msgid "Your payment could not be completed."
msgstr "Não foi possível concluir seu pagamento."

#. In-app notice while the renewal payment of a UR Pro subscription has failed (a declined card, for example) and the store is still retrying it. If no payment goes through before the retries end, the subscription is cancelled. Keep UR Pro and Pro (the plan's name) unchanged. Didn't go through = failed.
msgctxt "payment_past_due_notice"
msgid "Your UR Pro payment didn't go through. Update your payment method to keep Pro."
msgstr "O pagamento do UR Pro não foi concluído. Atualize sua forma de pagamento para continuar com o Pro."

#. Button on the notice that a UR Pro payment didn't go through: opens the subscription page on ur.io in the browser, where the payment method (a card, for example) is updated.
msgctxt "payment_past_due_update_payment"
msgid "Update payment method"
msgstr "Atualizar forma de pagamento"

