msgid "{0} for your first year, then {1}/year. Cancel anytime."
msgstr "{0} no primeiro ano, depois {1}/ano. Cancele quando quiser."

#. Plan picker: the terms line under the button for the yearly plan with its trial.
msgctxt "plan_terms_yearly"
msgid "{0} day free, then {1}/year. Cancel anytime."
msgid_plural "{0} days free, then {1}/year. Cancel anytime."
msgstr[0] "{0} dia grátis, depois {1}/ano. Cancele quando quiser."
msgstr[1] "{0} dias grátis, depois {1}/ano. Cancele quando quiser."

#. Plan picker terms line for the yearly plan without a trial or offer. {yearly_price} is a formatted price, for example $59.99.
msgctxt "plan_terms_yearly_billed_today"
msgid "{} billed today, then every year. Cancel anytime."
msgstr "{} cobrados hoje, depois todo ano. Cancele quando quiser."

#. Used in Shared/Views/SolanaSignMessageSheet.swift.
msgctxt "please_install_phantom_or_solflare_to_use_this"
msgid "Please install Phantom or Solflare to use this feature"
msgstr "Instale o Phantom ou Solflare para usar este recurso"

#. Used in Shared/Intents/ConnectIntent.swift.
msgctxt "please_login_to_urnetwork"
msgid "Please login to URnetwork"
msgstr "Faça login no URnetwork"

#. Used in Shared/Intents/ConnectIntent.swift.
msgctxt "please_login_to_urnetwork_to_connect"
msgid "Please login to URnetwork to connect"
msgstr "Faça login no URnetwork para conectar"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "please_try_again"
msgid "Please try again."
msgstr "Por favor, tente novamente."

#. Profile
msgctxt "please_wait"
msgid "Please wait a few minutes and try again."
msgstr "Aguarde alguns minutos e tente novamente."

msgctxt "plus_amount"
msgid "+{}"
msgstr "+{}"

#. Suffix appended to a truncated list of host names and addresses ("a, b, …, c + 3 more"). The argument is the number of values omitted from the list.
msgctxt "plus_n_more"
msgid "+ {} more"
msgid_plural "+ {} more"
msgstr[0] "+ mais {}"
msgstr[1] "+ mais {}"

#. Points leaderboard: tab label, stat tile label and sort chip.
msgctxt "points"
msgid "Points"
msgstr "Pontos"

#. Headline label of the earnings screen.
msgctxt "points_earned"
msgid "Points earned"
msgstr "Pontos ganhos"

#. Points leaderboard: the explanation under the list header.
msgctxt "points_leaderboard_description"
msgid "All-time points. A block is one finalized epoch; the streak counts consecutive blocks with points, ending at the latest one."
msgstr "Pontos de todos os tempos. Um bloco é uma época finalizada; a sequência conta blocos consecutivos com pontos até o último."

#. Points leaderboard: shown when no network has points yet (every ranked network is listed, so the list is empty only before the first snapshot).
msgctxt "points_leaderboard_empty"
msgid "No one is on the points leaderboard yet."
msgstr "Ainda não há ninguém no placar de pontos."

#. Points leaderboard: shown under the own-stats card while the name switch is off. The network is listed either way, as Anonymous until the switch is on.
msgctxt "points_leaderboard_private_hint"
msgid "Your network appears as Anonymous until you turn this on."
msgstr "Sua rede aparece como Anônimo até você ativar esta opção."

#. Points count with unit for history rows.
msgctxt "points_short"
msgid "{} pts"
msgstr "{} pts"

#. Connect drawer: post quantum encryption toggle label.
msgctxt "post_quantum_encryption"
msgid "Post Quantum Encryption"
msgstr "Criptografia pós-quântica"

#. Connect drawer: note under the post quantum encryption toggle. Plaintext fallback applies when the provider does not support the e2e sessions.
msgctxt "post_quantum_encryption_fallback_note"
msgid "Fallback enabled (temporary)"
msgstr "Fallback ativado (temporário)"

#. Account tab: post quantum identity panel title.
msgctxt "post_quantum_identity"
msgid "Post Quantum Provider Identity"
msgstr "Identidade pós-quântica do provedor"

#. Account tab: explanation under the post quantum identity panel — what the identity key is and how verifying provider keys detects interception.
msgctxt "post_quantum_identity_explanation"
msgid "Your provider identity key is stored locally on this device. If any peer's key appears different than their locally stored key, it means the network operator cannot be trusted."
msgstr "Sua chave de identidade de provedor é armazenada localmente neste dispositivo. Se a chave de algum par aparecer diferente da chave armazenada localmente, significa que não se pode confiar no operador da rede."

#. Button under the strict Private DNS notice that opens the Android wireless/network settings screen (there is no public Private DNS intent).
msgctxt "private_dns_open_settings"
msgid "Open network settings"
msgstr "Abrir configurações de rede"

#. Muted notice on the connect screen shown while connected when Android Private DNS is set to a strict hostname, which sends DoT lookups outside the tunnel. %1$s is the configured DNS provider host.
msgctxt "private_dns_strict_notice"
msgid "Private DNS is set to {}. Android sends lookups there directly instead of through URnetwork. If sites stop loading, set Private DNS to Automatic."
msgstr "O DNS privado está definido como {}. O Android envia as consultas diretamente para lá em vez de passar pela URnetwork. Se os sites pararem de carregar, defina o DNS privado como Automático."

#. Title of the advanced private extender fields: one extender with a secret that replaces discovery.
msgctxt "private_extender"
msgid "Private extender"
msgstr "Extensor privado"

#. Help text under the private extender fields.
msgctxt "private_extender_hint"
msgid "A private extender replaces every discovered extender. Leave it empty to use discovery."
msgstr "Um extensor privado substitui todos os extensores descobertos. Deixe em branco para usar a descoberta."

#. Label of the private extender IP address field.
msgctxt "private_extender_ip"
msgid "IP address"
msgstr "Endereço IP"

#. Label of the private extender secret field.
msgctxt "private_extender_secret"
msgid "Secret"
msgstr "Segredo"

#. Network name when privacy is enabled
msgctxt "private_network"
msgid "Private Network"
msgstr "Rede privada"

#. Upgrade screen: the one-line Pro benefits prompt under the Get Pro title.
msgctxt "pro_benefits_simple"
msgid "The best version of URnetwork."
msgstr "A melhor versão do URnetwork."

#. Title of a notice on the app's main screen and above the list of proxies (the device list, ur.io's Proxies page), shown before the free plan loses SOCKS and WireGuard: the account is not on Pro, and its hosted proxies hold SOCKS or WireGuard, which are Pro features. pro_features_upgrade_message is the body, and Get Pro the button. Keep Pro as it is.
msgctxt "pro_features_in_use"
msgid "Pro features in use"
msgstr "Recursos Pro em uso"

#. Title of a notice on the app's main screen and above the list of proxies (the device list, ur.io's Proxies page), shown once the free plan no longer includes SOCKS and WireGuard: the account is not on Pro, and its hosted proxies stopped accepting SOCKS and WireGuard connections. pro_features_stopped_message is the body. Keep SOCKS and WireGuard as they are.
msgctxt "pro_features_stopped"
msgid "SOCKS and WireGuard stopped working"
msgstr "SOCKS e WireGuard pararam de funcionar"

#. Body under pro_features_stopped: SOCKS and WireGuard are Pro features, so the hosted proxies of an account on the free plan no longer accept SOCKS or WireGuard connections, while their HTTP and HTTPS proxies keep working. Upgrading to Pro turns them back on: SOCKS at once, WireGuard within 30 minutes. Get Pro is the button beside it. Keep SOCKS, WireGuard, HTTP, HTTPS and Pro as they are.
msgctxt "pro_features_stopped_message"
msgid "SOCKS and WireGuard are part of Pro, so they no longer work on your proxies. HTTP and HTTPS still work. Upgrade to turn them back on. WireGuard can take up to 30 minutes to reconnect."
msgstr "SOCKS e WireGuard fazem parte do Pro, então não funcionam mais nos seus proxies. HTTP e HTTPS continuam funcionando. Faça upgrade para reativá-los. O WireGuard pode levar até 30 minutos para se reconectar."

#. Body under pro_features_in_use, before the free plan loses SOCKS and WireGuard: the account's hosted proxies use SOCKS or WireGuard, which are part of the Pro plan, and upgrading keeps them working. Get Pro is the button beside it. Keep SOCKS, WireGuard and Pro as they are.
msgctxt "pro_features_upgrade_message"
msgid "SOCKS and WireGuard proxies are part of Pro. Upgrade to keep using them."
msgstr "Os proxies SOCKS e WireGuard fazem parte do Pro. Faça upgrade para continuar usando-os."

#. Call to action
msgctxt "processing_payment"
msgid "Processing payment"
msgstr "Processando pagamento"

#. Used in Main/Connect/ConnectButton/StatusIndicator/ConnectStatusIndicator.swift.
msgctxt "processing_subscription_balance"
msgid "Processing subscription balance..."
msgstr "Processando saldo da assinatura..."

#. Account Screen
msgctxt "profile"
msgid "Profile"
msgstr "Perfil"

#. VPN providers list option for promoted providers
msgctxt "promoted"
msgid "Promoted"
msgstr "Promovido"

#. A header for a section of the provider list that shows recommended locations.
msgctxt "promoted_locations"
msgid "Promoted Locations"
msgstr "Locais promovidos"

#. Label of the switch that turns on providing bandwidth to the network.
msgctxt "provide"
msgid "Provide"
msgstr "Fornecer"

#. First bullet on the onboarding Contribute bandwidth page.
msgctxt "provide_intro_bullet_devices"
msgid "Allow your devices to share internet with each other"
msgstr "Permita que seus dispositivos compartilhem internet entre si"

#. Second bullet on the onboarding Contribute bandwidth page, with a heart.
msgctxt "provide_intro_bullet_people"
msgid "Share your internet with other people ❤️"
msgstr "Compartilhe sua internet com outras pessoas ❤️"

#. Lead line above the two bullets on the onboarding Contribute bandwidth page.
msgctxt "provide_intro_lead"
msgid "Your choice, completely optional:"
msgstr "Você escolhe, é totalmente opcional:"

#. Call to action
msgctxt "provide_mode"
msgid "Provide mode"
msgstr "Modo de fornecimento"

#. One-line explanation of the Always provide mode in the onboarding Contribute bandwidth picker.
msgctxt "provide_mode_always_description"
msgid "Provides to everyone whenever the app is running."
msgstr "Fornece para todos sempre que o app estiver em execução."

#. One-line explanation of the Auto provide mode in the onboarding Contribute bandwidth picker: public providing only while connected, same-network peers otherwise.
msgctxt "provide_mode_auto_description"
msgid "Provides to everyone while you're connected, otherwise only to your own devices."
msgstr "Fornece para todos enquanto você está conectado; caso contrário, só para os seus próprios dispositivos."

#. One-line explanation of the Network provide mode in the onboarding Contribute bandwidth picker: the private provider for the network's own devices.
msgctxt "provide_mode_network_description"
msgid "Provides only to your own network's devices."
msgstr "Fornece apenas para os dispositivos da sua própria rede."

#. Settings, under the cellular provide toggle: the label of the choice of what providing does while the device runs on battery.
msgctxt "provide_power_mode"
msgid "When on battery"
msgstr "Quando estiver na bateria"

#. Settings, provide power choice under "When on battery": keep providing on battery, also in Battery Saver.
msgctxt "provide_power_mode_always"
msgid "Keep providing"
msgstr "Continuar fornecendo"

#. Settings, provide power choice under "When on battery": provide only while the device is charging, and pause on battery.
msgctxt "provide_power_mode_charging_only"
msgid "Pause until charging"
msgstr "Pausar até carregar"

#. Settings, provide power choice under "When on battery" (the default): pause providing while Battery Saver is on.
msgctxt "provide_power_mode_pause_in_battery_saver"
msgid "Pause in Battery Saver"
msgstr "Pausar na Economia de bateria"

#. Settings, provide power choice under "When on battery" on iOS and macOS (the default): pause providing while Low Power Mode is on. Use the system's own name for Low Power Mode.
msgctxt "provide_power_mode_pause_in_low_power"
msgid "Pause in Low Power Mode"
msgstr "Pausar no Modo Pouca Energia"

#. Compact duration a provider has been connected, as hours and minutes (e.g. 3h 24m). {hours} is the whole hours, {minutes} the remaining minutes.
msgctxt "provider_connected_duration_hours"
msgid "{0}h {1}m"
msgstr "{0} h {1} min"

#. Compact duration a provider has been connected, as minutes (e.g. 24m).
msgctxt "provider_connected_duration_minutes"
msgid "{}m"
msgstr "{} min"

#. Compact duration a provider has been connected, as seconds (e.g. 42s).
msgctxt "provider_connected_duration_seconds"
msgid "{}s"
msgstr "{} s"

#. A label for the provider contracts screen.
msgctxt "provider_contracts"
msgid "Provider contracts"
msgstr "Contratos do provedor"

#. A label that shows the number of providers for a location. The argument is the number of providers.
msgctxt "provider_count"
msgid "{} provider"
msgid_plural "{} providers"
msgstr[0] "{} provedor"
msgstr[1] "{} provedores"

#. Post quantum identity: title of the connected provider identity key details view.
msgctxt "provider_identities"
msgid "Provider Identities"
msgstr "Identidades dos provedores"

#. Provider card, under the provide mode row: why an enabled provider gets no traffic. The device is in Auto mode and not connected, so it shares only with the user's own devices. 'Always' is the provide mode label (key always).
msgctxt "provider_idle_auto_not_connected"
msgid "Auto shares with everyone only while you're connected. Choose Always to earn while idle."
msgstr "Automático compartilha com todos apenas enquanto você está conectado. Escolha Sempre para ganhar também quando não estiver conectado."

#. Provider card, under the provide mode row: the provide mode is Network, so the device shares only with the user's own devices. 'Always' is the provide mode label (key always).
msgctxt "provider_idle_network_only"
msgid "Shared only with your own devices. Choose Always to share with everyone."
msgstr "Compartilhado apenas com seus próprios dispositivos. Escolha Sempre para compartilhar com todos."

#. Provider card, under the provide mode row: the device provides to everyone but has carried no traffic yet.
msgctxt "provider_idle_no_traffic_yet"
msgid "New providers need several hours of steady uptime and a speed test before clients are sent to them. Traffic also depends on demand in your region."
msgstr "Novos provedores precisam de várias horas de funcionamento estável e de um teste de velocidade antes de receberem clientes. O tráfego também depende da demanda na sua região."

#. Provider card, under the provide mode row: providing is paused because Battery Saver is on and the provide power setting pauses in Battery Saver (the default).
msgctxt "provider_idle_paused_battery_saver"
msgid "Paused: Battery Saver is on."
msgstr "Pausado: a Economia de bateria está ativada."

#. Provider card on iOS and macOS, under the provide mode row: providing is paused because Low Power Mode is on and the provide power setting pauses in Low Power Mode (the default). Use the system's own name for Low Power Mode.
msgctxt "provider_idle_paused_low_power"
msgid "Paused: Low Power Mode is on."
msgstr "Pausado: o Modo Pouca Energia está ativado."

#. Provider card, under the provide mode row: providing is paused because the current network can't be used for providing (no network, or a constrained or metered one).
msgctxt "provider_idle_paused_no_network"
msgid "Paused: this device can't provide on its current network."
msgstr "Pausado: este dispositivo não pode fornecer na rede atual."

#. Provider card, under the provide mode row: providing is paused because the provide power setting provides only while charging and the device is on battery.
msgctxt "provider_idle_paused_not_charging"
msgid "Paused: this device isn't charging."
msgstr "Pausado: este dispositivo não está carregando."

#. Provider card, under the provide mode row: providing is paused because it is limited to Wi-Fi and the device is on another network.
msgctxt "provider_idle_paused_wifi_only"
msgid "Paused: providing is set to Wi-Fi only, and this device isn't on Wi-Fi."
msgstr "Pausado: o fornecimento está configurado somente para Wi-Fi, e este dispositivo não está no Wi-Fi."

#. Row subtitle in the provider locations list when a provider's location is not known.
msgctxt "provider_location_unknown"
msgid "Location unknown"
msgstr "Localização desconhecida"

#. Empty state of the provider locations sheet when no providers are connected.
msgctxt "provider_locations_empty"
msgid "No providers connected"
msgstr "Nenhum provedor conectado"

#. Title of the sheet that lists the connected providers and their locations.
msgctxt "provider_locations_title"
msgid "Provider Locations"
msgstr "Localizações dos provedores"

#. Shown instead of the provider list when the device's window state cannot be read, because the network extension hosting it is not running. Never present an empty list as "no providers" in that case.
msgctxt "provider_locations_unavailable"
msgid "Provider details are unavailable until connected"
msgstr "Os detalhes do provedor não estão disponíveis até conectar"

#. Title of a section that shows statistics about the provider.
msgctxt "provider_statistics"
msgid "Provider statistics"
msgstr "Estatísticas do provedor"

#. Title of the provider chart, shown with the other provider plots, of how many times clients were offered this device each minute over the last hour.
msgctxt "provider_status_demand"
msgid "Demand"
msgstr "Demanda"

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: explanation under the country the device is offered in.
msgctxt "provider_status_help_country"
msgid "Clients who choose this country can be offered this device."
msgstr "Este dispositivo pode ser oferecido aos clientes que escolherem este país."

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: explanation under the delay.
msgctxt "provider_status_help_latency"
msgid "Delay measured above what is expected for this location. Lower delay is offered more often."
msgstr "Latência medida acima do esperado para esta localização. Menor latência é oferecida com mais frequência."

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: explanation under the 12-hour reliability.
msgctxt "provider_status_help_reliability_12h"
msgid "How steadily this device stayed connected over the last 12 hours. It must reach the minimum to be offered to clients; from a fresh start this takes about 8 hours of steady uptime."
msgstr "Quão estável este dispositivo ficou conectado nas últimas 12 horas. Ela precisa atingir o mínimo para que o dispositivo seja oferecido aos clientes; a partir de um novo início, isso leva cerca de 8 horas de funcionamento estável."

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: explanation under the 1-hour reliability.
msgctxt "provider_status_help_reliability_1h"
msgid "How steadily this device stayed connected over the last hour. It must reach the minimum to be offered to clients; disconnects lower it and steady uptime raises it."
msgstr "Quão estável este dispositivo ficou conectado na última hora. Ela precisa atingir o mínimo para que o dispositivo seja oferecido aos clientes; desconexões a reduzem e o funcionamento estável a aumenta."

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: explanation under the 5-minute reliability.
msgctxt "provider_status_help_reliability_5m"
msgid "How steadily this device stayed connected over the last 5 minutes. It scales how often clients are offered this device; staying connected raises it."
msgstr "Quão estável este dispositivo ficou conectado nos últimos 5 minutos. Influencia a frequência com que ele é oferecido aos clientes; permanecer conectado a aumenta."

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: explanation under a reliability measured over another window.
msgctxt "provider_status_help_reliability_other"
msgid "How steadily this device stayed connected over a longer window. It must reach the minimum to be offered to clients."
msgstr "Quão estável este dispositivo ficou conectado em um período mais longo. Ela precisa atingir o mínimo para que o dispositivo seja oferecido aos clientes."

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: explanation under the speed test.
msgctxt "provider_status_help_speed_test"
msgid "Speed measured through this device. Faster connections are offered more often."
msgstr "Velocidade medida por este dispositivo. Conexões mais rápidas são oferecidas com mais frequência."

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: explanation under both tiers.
msgctxt "provider_status_help_tier"
msgid "Clients try lower tiers first. 0 is best; 3 means past the speed or delay cutoff."
msgstr "Os clientes tentam primeiro os níveis mais baixos. 0 é o melhor; 3 significa que passou do limite de velocidade ou de latência."

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: explanation under the network checks.
msgctxt "provider_status_help_url_checks"
msgid "Test sites that loaded through this connection in the last 8 hours. Most must load; filtering by your internet provider lowers it."
msgstr "Sites de teste que carregaram por esta conexão nas últimas 8 horas. A maioria precisa carregar; a filtragem do seu provedor de internet reduz o resultado."

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: explanation under both selection weights.
msgctxt "provider_status_help_weight"
msgid "Combines reliability, speed and passed network checks. Clients are offered providers with a higher weight more often."
msgstr "Combina confiabilidade, velocidade e verificações de rede aprovadas. Provedores com peso maior são oferecidos aos clientes com mais frequência."

#. Provider card chart: shown when every bar is zero.
msgctxt "provider_status_histogram_empty"
msgid "Not offered to clients in the last hour"
msgstr "Não foi oferecido a clientes na última hora"

#. Provider card chart: label under the right (current minute) end of the axis.
msgctxt "provider_status_histogram_end"
msgid "Now"
msgstr "Agora"

#. Provider card chart: label under the left (oldest) end of the 60-minute axis.
msgctxt "provider_status_histogram_start"
msgid "60 min ago"
msgstr "há 60 min"

#. Provider card: title of a 60-bar chart of how many times the network offered this device to clients in each minute of the last hour.
msgctxt "provider_status_histogram_title"
msgid "Times clients were offered this device, per minute, last hour"
msgstr "Vezes em que este dispositivo foi oferecido a clientes, por minuto, na última hora"

#. Provider card chart: total of the 60 bars. The argument is the number of times this device was offered to clients in the last hour.
msgctxt "provider_status_histogram_total"
msgid "{} time in the last hour"
msgid_plural "{} times in the last hour"
msgstr[0] "{} vez na última hora"
msgstr[1] "{} vezes na última hora"

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: label of the measured delay (latency) in milliseconds.
msgctxt "provider_status_number_latency"
msgid "Delay"
msgstr "Latência"

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: label of the reliability over the last 12 hours.
msgctxt "provider_status_number_reliability_12h"
msgid "Reliability, last 12 hours"
msgstr "Confiabilidade, últimas 12 horas"

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: label of the reliability over the last hour.
msgctxt "provider_status_number_reliability_1h"
msgid "Reliability, last hour"
msgstr "Confiabilidade, última hora"

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: label of the reliability over the last 5 minutes (a share of steady uptime).
msgctxt "provider_status_number_reliability_5m"
msgid "Reliability, last 5 minutes"
msgstr "Confiabilidade, últimos 5 minutos"

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: label of the measured speed.
msgctxt "provider_status_number_speed_test"
msgid "Speed test"
msgstr "Teste de velocidade"

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: label of the device's tier for quality-ranked requests (0 is best).
msgctxt "provider_status_number_tier_quality"
msgid "Tier (quality)"
msgstr "Nível (qualidade)"

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: label of the device's tier for speed-ranked requests.
msgctxt "provider_status_number_tier_speed"
msgid "Tier (speed)"
msgstr "Nível (velocidade)"

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: label of the network check result (test sites loaded through the device).
msgctxt "provider_status_number_url_checks"
msgid "Network checks"
msgstr "Verificações de rede"

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: label of the device's selection weight for quality-ranked requests (a relative number).
msgctxt "provider_status_number_weight_quality"
msgid "Selection weight (quality)"
msgstr "Peso de seleção (qualidade)"

#. Provider status 'Why?' list: label of the device's selection weight for speed-ranked requests.
msgctxt "provider_status_number_weight_speed"
msgid "Selection weight (speed)"
msgstr "Peso de seleção (velocidade)"

#. Provider status reason (egress_failing): too many test sites failed to load through the device.
msgctxt "provider_status_reason_egress_failing"
msgid "Too many test sites failed to load through this connection in the last 8 hours. Clients are offered this device only when checked providers run out."
msgstr "Muitos sites de teste não carregaram por esta conexão nas últimas 8 horas. Este dispositivo só é oferecido aos clientes quando os provedores verificados se esgotam."

#. Provider status reason (egress_unprobed): the network check (loading test sites through the device) has not run yet.
msgctxt "provider_status_reason_egress_unprobed"
msgid "The network check hasn't run on this connection yet. Until it passes, clients are offered this device only when checked providers run out."
msgstr "A verificação de rede ainda não foi feita nesta conexão. Até ser aprovada, este dispositivo só é oferecido aos clientes quando os provedores verificados se esgotam."

#. Provider status reason (location_invalid): the device was seen at more than one IP address, or its location is unknown.
msgctxt "provider_status_reason_location_invalid"
msgid "This device is connecting from more than one address, or its location is unknown. Clients are offered only devices with one address and a known location."
msgstr "Este dispositivo está se conectando de mais de um endereço, ou sua localização é desconhecida. Somente dispositivos com um único endereço e uma localização conhecida são oferecidos aos clientes."

#. Provider status reason (network_only). 'Always' is the provide mode label (key always).
msgctxt "provider_status_reason_network_only"
msgid "This device provides only to your own devices. Choose Always to share with everyone."
msgstr "Este dispositivo fornece apenas para seus próprios dispositivos. Escolha Sempre para compartilhar com todos."

#. Provider status reason (none): passes every check.
msgctxt "provider_status_reason_none"
msgid "Everything checks out. How often clients are offered this device depends on demand in its region and on how it ranks against nearby providers."
msgstr "Está tudo certo. A frequência com que este dispositivo é oferecido aos clientes depende da demanda na região dele e da sua posição em relação aos provedores próximos."

#. Provider status reason (not_connected).
msgctxt "provider_status_reason_not_connected"
msgid "This device isn't connected right now. Clients are offered only connected devices."
msgstr "Este dispositivo não está conectado no momento. Somente dispositivos conectados são oferecidos aos clientes."

#. Provider status reason (not_eligible): one generic reason for every anti-abuse check. Keep it generic; do not add detail.
msgctxt "provider_status_reason_not_eligible"
msgid "This connection isn't eligible to provide right now."
msgstr "Esta conexão não está qualificada para fornecer no momento."

#. Provider status reason (not_providing): the device is not set to provide.
msgctxt "provider_status_reason_not_providing"
msgid "This device isn't set to share its connection."
msgstr "Este dispositivo não está configurado para compartilhar sua conexão."

#. Provider status reason (reliability_low): the last hour's reliability is below the minimum.
msgctxt "provider_status_reason_reliability_low"
msgid "Reliability over the last hour is below what clients need. It rises with every minute this device stays connected; disconnects lower it."
msgstr "A confiabilidade da última hora está abaixo do que os clientes precisam. Ela aumenta a cada minuto em que este dispositivo permanece conectado; desconexões a reduzem."

#. Provider status reason (reliability_warming_up): steady for the last hour, but the 12-hour reliability is still below the minimum.
msgctxt "provider_status_reason_reliability_warming_up"
msgid "Building reliability. This device has been steady for the last hour; clients are offered it once its 12-hour reliability reaches the minimum, about 8 hours after a fresh start."
msgstr "Construindo confiabilidade. Este dispositivo ficou estável na última hora; ele será oferecido aos clientes quando sua confiabilidade de 12 horas atingir o mínimo, cerca de 8 horas após um novo início."

#. Provider status reason (slow): past the speed or delay cutoff.
msgctxt "provider_status_reason_slow"
msgid "This connection measured slower than clients need, so it is offered much less often."
msgstr "Esta conexão foi medida como mais lenta do que os clientes precisam, por isso é oferecida com muito menos frequência."

#. Provider status reason (speed_test_missing).
msgctxt "provider_status_reason_speed_test_missing"
msgid "No speed test yet. Until one completes, clients are offered this device much less often."
msgstr "Ainda não há teste de velocidade. Até que um seja concluído, este dispositivo é oferecido aos clientes com muito menos frequência."

