#. ur.io Connect screen, out-of-balance notice for a Pro account whose plan data is used up (title: Data limit reached). Pro's data is granted at 00:00 UTC on the 1st of each month; a data pack (sold on ur.io, the Buy data button beside this line) adds data at once. Keep Pro and UTC as is.
msgctxt "site_data_limit_pro"
msgid "Your Pro data for this month is used up. It renews on the 1st of next month (UTC), and a data pack adds more now."
msgstr "Seus dados do Pro deste mês acabaram. Eles são renovados no dia 1º do próximo mês (UTC), e um pacote de dados adiciona mais agora."

#. Extension status: setup in flight
msgctxt "site_ext_setting_up"
msgid "Setting up…"
msgstr "Configurando…"

